%description:
Tests the default of retainSackAfterRto (false), in the scenario of
tcp_sack_rto_1: the retransmission timeout clears the SACKed marks, as RFC 2018
section 8 and RFC 5682 step 1 say, and the ACK of the retransmission (B004)
carries no SACK option. So the client retransmits 3001:4001 too (A009), which
the server already holds and reports as a duplicate (B006).

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

sim-time-limit = 10s
*.cli_app.sendScript="1.0 6000"
*.*_tcp.mss = 1000
*.*_tcp.sackSupport = true
*.*_tcp.delayedAcksEnabled = false
*.cli_tcp.increasedIWEnabled = true
*.cli_tcp.dupthresh = 10
*.cli_tcp.retainSackAfterRto = false
*.tcptester.script="a3 delete; a5 delete; b4 strip 5"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[4.001 A007] A.1000 > B.2000: A 1:1001(1000) ack 501 win 16384 
[4.003 B004] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 2001 win 15384   Option(s): NOP NOP# removing options
[4.005 A008] A.1000 > B.2000: A 2001:3001(1000) ack 501 win 16384 
[4.005 A009] A.1000 > B.2000: A 3001:4001(1000) ack 501 win 16384 
[4.007 B005] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 4001 win 16384 
[4.007 B006] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 4001 win 16384   Option(s): NOP NOP SACK[3001,4001)
[4.009 A010] A.1000 > B.2000: A 4001:5001(1000) ack 501 win 16384 
[4.009 A011] A.1000 > B.2000: A 5001:6001(1000) ack 501 win 16384 
[4.011 B007] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 5001 win 16384 
[4.011 B008] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 6001 win 16384 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
